@startuml F5.8-D01-listar-eventos-secretaria
title F5.8-D01 — Listar eventos (secretaria)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EventController" as Ctrl
participant "ListEventsUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: /secretaria/eventos
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /events
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT cursos vinculados
note right of UC
  CONCLUIDO sem editar/excluir;
  host se event.host
end note
Postgres --> UC: page
UC --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Sec: tabela filtrada

@enduml
